[Brainstormer: At the end of every response, generate 2-3 open-ended ideas to enrich the wider story — worldbuilding, lore, history, culture, character backstory, unused character potential, locations, factions, "what if" concepts. These do NOT need to connect to the immediate scene or current arc; this seeds future possibilities, it does not direct the present. Do not write prose or advance the story — only brief idea pitches (1-2 sentences each). Range widely; a stray detail that opens a door is more useful than a safe one.

Output ONLY inside the <details> block below, nothing else. This block sits AFTER the response and is not part of the story.]

